  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property includes public beach access at Wall Street with 1 set of beach chairs and the Beach Better Box included (March 1 - October 31) . Additional beach service chairs can be rented through Jake's Beach Service. Complimentary access to Rosemary Beach® Fitness and complimentary court time at Rosemary Beach® Racquet Club also included. <br><br>Located in charming Inlet Beach, Worry Be Gone is a sleek modern-coastal oasis! This 3 -story luxury rental features 6 bedrooms, 6 baths, and fabulous outdoor gathering spaces. With easy beach access and a private pool, you can be sure that your vacation will be worry free at Worry Be Gone!<br><br> Upon entering the first floor, guests are greeted by a grand staircase and terrazzo tiled floors. Just beyond the stairs awaits the first guest bedroom, featuring 2 queens and a private en-suite bath. Moving further into the home, your guests can put up their feet in the family style common area with a wet bar and Xbox gaming console. Your kiddos will love the second guest room, which boasts two plush Queen over Queen bunks (four queen beds total) and its own en-suite bath!<br><br> Walk through the French doors and into your own piece of paradise. Lounge in style by the large private pool, complete with a sun shelf and spa. When you're ready to take a break from the sun, head into the shade of the screened living area. Enjoy the ocean breeze in front of the outdoor fireplace or turn on the large screen TV and enjoy all your favorite shows on the terrace. At Worry Be Gone, you will find ample seating perfect for your family gatherings!<br><br> Head up to the second floor for endless views and more gathering spaces. The chef in your family will love the Wolf and SubZero appliances in the kitchen! Take advantage of the built-in grill with a view, located on the balcony. A powder room, large laundry room, and the third guest room (boasting a King bed and en-suite with a walk-in shower) are also located on this level.<br><br> Two master bedrooms with private balconies and gulf views await your arrival on the third floor. Give yourself the 5-star treatment with a bath in the large soaking tub in the first master bedroom or find your Zen in the junior master en-suite walk-in shower.<br><br>Carriage House<br><br>Connected to the main house on the second floor, your guests will enjoy the privacy of the carriage house without feeling disconnected from the rest of the party in the main home. Featuring a private balcony from the living room with gulf views, a king bed, and kitchenette, your guests will have everything they need in the coziness of the carriage house!<br><br>Pool can be heated October 1st through May 1st for an additional fee. Hot tub heater can be scheduled when pool heater is off. Pool and hot tub cannot be heated simultaneously. <br><br>**No access to Rosemary Beaches and pools**<br>This home requires a 7 night stay, Saturday to Saturday during spring break, summer, Christmas, and New Years.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Worry Be Gone Cottage & Carriage"
        }
      ],
