    "description": [
      "Located in Inlet Beach, a neighborhood in Panama City Beach, this vacation home is near a water park and near the beach. The area's natural beauty can be seen at Alys Beach and Rosemary Beach, while Frank Brown Park and Shipwreck Island Waterpark are popular area attractions. Emerald Coast Mirror Maze and SkyWheel are also worth visiting. Spend some time exploring the area's activities, including winery tours."
