    "label": "Exceptional",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author": "Renae H.",
        "date": "2024-08-24T16:15:35Z",
        "id": "66ca07271ef4854d649c385c",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "We were a group of 14 - a multi-generation trip with our kids and the grands. Worry Be Gone Cottage & Carriage house is the perfect location. Enough good things can't be said... the pool area is exquisite. The house has so many great lounging areas and the bedrooms with en-suite are divine with a group this large. It's a very comfortable property, located a short bike ride away from lots of shops and restaurants. We utilized the bikes several times. We mostly ate at the house - we even had Sunshine Hibachi come for a wonderful dinner and entertainment. One night we had a seafood boil delivered from Emerald Coast Boil Company and let's just say we haven't stopped taking about the meal since. In addition we also, did a bonfire on the beach at sunset with s'mores from a company called Bonfires at the Beach - they get the permit, set up and tear down while keeping the fire stoked for the entire 3 hours. If you get a chance to rent a pontoon boat - Double Fun Pontoon Rentals is fabulous to work with. Overall, if you're looking for a retreat this is your place. We will be talking about this trip for YEARS!!!",
